From 1913aac4c398db582569507f31f8fadf6e087d87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: retake <ysfss@protonmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 12:00:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] ramips: mt76x8: shrink printk ring buffer to 16 KiB

The generic config uses LOG_BUF_SHIFT=17, 128 KiB of static .bss.  logd
copies kernel messages into its own buffer, so 16 KiB is enough on
64 MiB boards.  Saves 112 KiB.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: retake <ysfss@protonmail.com>
---
 target/linux/ramips/mt76x8/config-6.12 | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/target/linux/ramips/mt76x8/config-6.12 b/target/linux/ramips/mt76x8/config-6.12
index b3014c0..6be910f 100644
--- a/target/linux/ramips/mt76x8/config-6.12
+++ b/target/linux/ramips/mt76x8/config-6.12
@@ -99,6 +99,7 @@ CONFIG_IRQ_MIPS_CPU=y
 CONFIG_IRQ_WORK=y
 CONFIG_LIBFDT=y
 CONFIG_LOCK_DEBUGGING_SUPPORT=y
+CONFIG_LOG_BUF_SHIFT=14
 CONFIG_MDIO_BUS=y
 CONFIG_MDIO_DEVICE=y
 CONFIG_MDIO_DEVRES=y
